  "title": "Oven-Roasted Za'atar Chicken Breasts",
  "description": "This tender and juicy za'atar-marinated chicken gets an extra dose of za'atar seasoning right before being roasted in the oven. Serve with couscous or roasted potatoes.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-22T21:58:25-04:00",
